":0.3569,"playId":"401871092282","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.3854,"playId":"401871092285","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.3784,"playId":"401871092290","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.3591,"playId":"401871092293","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.3208,"playId":"401871092296","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.3418,"playId":"401871092302","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.3404,"playId":"401871092308","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.3397,"playId":"401871092306","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.3597,"playId":"401871092311","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.3907,"playId":"401871092315","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.3706,"playId":"401871092318","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.3696,"playId":"401871092322","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.3743,"playId":"401871092327","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.3968,"playId":"401871092331","tiePercentage":0}],"gameInfo":{"venue":{"id":"3775","guid":"88233998-8c51-3514-888b-a586c4047cb9","fullName":"Joan C. Edwards Stadium","address":{"city":"Huntington","state":"WV","zipCode":"25703","country":"USA"},"grass":false,"images":[{"href":"https://a.espncdn.com/i/venues/college-football/day/interior/3775.jpg","width":2000,"height":1125,"alt":"","rel":["full","day","interior"]}]},"attendance":21904},"article":{"headline":"Judah Price's late TD helps Marshall edge South Alabama 20-13","description":"— Judah Price scored on a 5-yard run with 1:49 remaining in the fourth quarter as Marshall answered a late South Alabama touchdown and held on for a 20-13 win Tuesday night.","story":"HUNTINGTON, W.Va. -- — <a href=\"https://x.com/HerdFB/status/2112739044937679254\"><a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5161776/judah-price\" target=\"_new\">Judah Price</a> scored on a 5-yard run with 1:49 remaining</a> in the fourth quarter as Marshall answered a late South Alabama touchdown and held on for a 20-13 win Tuesday night.\n\n\r\n              The Thundering Herd (4-3, 1-2 Sun Belt) held South Alabama to 326 total yards after entering giving up 447.3 yards per game — one of the worst marks in college football — to seal their first conference win of the season.\n\n\r\n              South Alabama (4-3, 2-1) tied it at 13 on PJ Martin’s 19-yard touchdown run with 4:38 left, capping a 13-play, 80-yard drive.\n\n\r\n              Marshall responded with an eight-play, 75-yard drive that Price finished with the go-ahead touchdown.\n\n\r\n              The teams were tied 6-6 at halftime after <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5294118/jorge-diaz-nicolas\" target=\"_new\">Jorge Diaz Nicolas</a> made field goals of 47 and 48 yards for Marshall and <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5185701/davis-little\" target=\"_new\">Davis Little</a> connected from 29 and 42 yards for South Alabama.\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4685697/zion-turner\" target=\"_new\">Zion Turner</a> gave Marshall its first lead on a 3-yard touchdown run with 3:25 left in the third. He threw for 181 yards and added 45 yards rushing.\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5158251/khalil-wilkins\" target=\"_new\">Khalil Wilkins</a> led Marshall with 69 yards rushing, while Price finished with 30 yards and a touchdown.\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5295070/keenan-phillips\" target=\"_new\">Keenan Phillips</a> rushed for 70 yards for South Alabama. <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5148858/jared-hollins\" target=\"_new\">Jared Hollins</a> threw for 148 yards and was intercepted once.\n\n\r\n              <hl2>Up next</hl2>\r\n              Marshall: At Old Dominion on Oct. 31.\n\n\r\n              South Alabama: Hosts Louisiana Tech on Oct. 31.\n\n\r\n              ------\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"https://apnews.com/newsletters\">Sign up for Top 25 poll alerts here</a>, visit <a href=\"https://apnews.com/hub/ap-top-25-college-football-poll\">the Top 25 here</a> and see AP’s full <a href=\"https://apnews.com/hub/college-football\">college football coverage here</a>","published":"2026-10-21T03:15:07Z"}}